 124:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     [..]
 125:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     Use Function @ref HAL_USART_RegisterCallback() to register a user callback.
 126:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     Function @ref HAL_USART_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
 127:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) TxHalfCpltCallback        : Tx Half Complete Callback.
 128:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) TxCpltCallback            : Tx Complete Callback.
 129:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) RxHalfCpltCallback        : Rx Half Complete Callback.
 130:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) RxCpltCallback            : Rx Complete Callback.
 131:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) TxRxCpltCallback          : Tx Rx Complete Callback.
 132:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) ErrorCallback             : Error Callback.
 133:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) AbortCpltCallback         : Abort Complete Callback.
 134:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) MspInitCallback           : USART MspInit.
 135:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) MspDeInitCallback         : USART MspDeInit.
 136:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
 137:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     and a pointer to the user callback function.
 138:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c **** 
 139:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     [..]
 140:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     Use function @ref HAL_USART_UnRegisterCallback() to reset a callback to the default
 141:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     weak (surcharged) function.
 142:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     @ref HAL_USART_UnRegisterCallback() takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
 143:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     and the Callback ID.
 144:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     This function allows to reset following callbacks:
