 147:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) RxHalfCpltCallback        : Rx Half Complete Callback.
 148:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) RxCpltCallback            : Rx Complete Callback.
