 166:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     Callbacks can be registered/unregistered in HAL_USART_STATE_READY state only.
 167:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     Exception done MspInit/MspDeInit that can be registered/unregistered
 168:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     in HAL_USART_STATE_READY or HAL_USART_STATE_RESET state, thus registered (user)
 169:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     MspInit/DeInit callbacks can be used during the Init/DeInit.
 170:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     In that case first register the MspInit/MspDeInit user callbacks
 171:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     using @ref HAL_USART_RegisterCallback() before calling @ref HAL_USART_DeInit()
 172:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     or @ref HAL_USART_Init() function.
