 268:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****   (+) For the asynchronous mode only these parameters can be configured:
 269:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****       (++) Baud Rate
