 274:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****            Depending on the frame length defined by the M bit (8-bits or 9-bits),
 275:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****            please refer to Reference manual for possible USART frame formats.
 276:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****       (++) USART polarity
 277:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****       (++) USART phase
 278:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****       (++) USART LastBit
 279:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****       (++) Receiver/transmitter modes
