 730:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****         (++) Error is considered as Blocking : Transfer could not be completed properly and is abor
 731:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****              This concerns Overrun Error In Interrupt mode reception and all errors in DMA mode.
 732:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****              Error code is set to allow user to identify error type, and HAL_USART_ErrorCallback() 
